      "extract": "A rank two pre-MFC has two simple objects $\\{1,X\\}$. There are two fusion rings, $\\mathbb Z/2\\mathbb Z$ and $K(\\text{Fib})$. We start from the $\\mathbb Z/2\\mathbb Z$ case. ### $\\mathcal B\\simeq\\text{Vec}_{\\mathbb Z/2\\mathbb Z}^\\alpha$ The pre-MFCs $\\mathcal B$'s have two simple objects $\\{1,X_h\\}$. They obey the $\\mathbb Z/2\\mathbb Z$ fusion ring $$\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B,\\quad1\\otimes b\\cong b\\cong b\\otimes1,\\quad",
